    "['xconnect [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/1.1 family ccc', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the Juniper equivalent of the Cisco `xconnect vfi LDP1` command:\\n\\n##\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/1.1 family ccc\\nset routing-instances LDP1 instance-type virtual-switch\\nset routing-instances LDP1 interface ge-1/0/1.1\\nset routing-instances LDP1 route-distinguisher 1.1.1.1:1\\nset routing-instances LDP1 vrf-target target:1:1\\n##\\n\\nNote: The Juniper configuration requires multiple commands to achieve the same functionality as Cisco's single command. This creates:\\n1) A CCC (Circuit Cross Connect) interface\\n2) A virtual-switch routing instance (equivalent to VFI)\\n3) Associates the interface with the instance\\n4) Sets up VPN identifiers (RD and RT) for the L2VPN\", 'trans_template': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/1.1 family ccc'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set routing-instances LDP1 instance-type virtual-switch', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the Juniper equivalent of the Cisco `xconnect vfi LDP1` command:\\n\\n##\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/1.1 family ccc\\nset routing-instances LDP1 instance-type virtual-switch\\nset routing-instances LDP1 interface ge-1/0/1.1\\nset routing-instances LDP1 route-distinguisher 1.1.1.1:1\\nset routing-instances LDP1 vrf-target target:1:1\\n##\\n\\nNote: The Juniper configuration requires multiple commands to achieve the same functionality as Cisco's single command. This creates:\\n1) A CCC (Circuit Cross Connect) interface\\n2) A virtual-switch routing instance (equivalent to VFI)\\n3) Associates the interface with the instance\\n4) Sets up VPN identifiers (RD and RT) for the L2VPN\", 'trans_template': 'set routing-instances LDP1 instance-type virtual-switch'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_comm